## Aura and Cat Eye Almond Nails: The Finishes Taking Over NailTok in 2026

Aura nails have been circling the algorithm for a while. In 2026, they've landed on the almond shape specifically and the combination makes sense. The diffused, gradient-blended centre that defines the aura finish gets more visual space on an almond than on any shorter shape. The result is almost holographic, shifting between milky base and colour depending on the light.

The velvet cat eye is a different energy entirely: a magnetic gel technique that creates a directional shimmer across the nail surface, and on an almond the streak runs the full length of the nail for maximum effect. Deep berry, forest green, and inky navy are the colour directions performing best with velvet cat eye in 2026. It's one of the more technique-dependent trends on this list results vary significantly by application skill but when done well, it's the most distinctive finish currently running on NailTok.

