## What to Actually Book at Your Next Appointment

If you walk into a salon this season with no brief prepared, book the milky glazed almond. It's the most representative look of 2026's dominant aesthetic, it suits virtually every skin tone and length, and it photographs beautifully. From there, the pearl chrome upgrade is the most logical next step one finish choice that shifts the whole register.

For spring, the clean neutrals and micro-French directions are the strongest seasonal bets. Summer is where the moody tones and aura finishes will peak. If you want even more design direction before your appointment, <a href='/blog/almond-nail-ideas-2026'>our full 2026 almond nail ideas edit has 60+ designs</a> across every trend covered here.

The almond shape isn't going anywhere in 2026. It's just getting sharper.
